431/17 ≈ 25.35, 17*25=425, 431-425=6, not divisible.

431/19 ≈ 22.68, 19*22=418, 431-418=13, not divisible.

So, 431 is prime.

216 and 431: 216 factors are 2^3 * 3^3. 431 is prime and doesn't divide 216, so they are coprime.

Thus, m = 216, n = 431, so m + n = 216 + 431 = 647.
