Therefore, w - 8x = -7x => w = 8x - 7x = x.

So, w = x.

Now, let's check vector GH, which is (-x, w - 8x) = (-x, x - 8x) = (-x, -7x). Rotating this 90 degrees should give us vector HE. The rotation of (-x, -7x) is (7x, -x). Vector HE is (7x, -w) = (7x, -x). So, that matches.

