44 * 30 = 1320

1350 - 1320 = 30

So, 1350 / 44 = 30 + 30/44 = 30 + 15/22 ≈ 30 + 0.6818 ≈ 30.6818 seconds

So, T is approximately 30.6818 seconds.

Now, the distance the powderman has run is 8 yards per second * T seconds.

So, distance = 8 * 30.6818 ≈ 245.4544 yards

